hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"73","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne fajr ki do rak'aton mein (Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun) aur (Qul huwal lahu ahad) padhi."
"74","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tawaf ki do rak'aton mein Ikhlas ki do suraton: (Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun) aur (Qul huwal lahu ahad) padhi."
"75","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) witr ki pehli rak'at mein (Sabbih isma rabbikal a'la), doosri mein (Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun) aur teesri mein (Qul huwal lahu ahad) padhte the."
